      },
      "isNameUserDefined": true,
      "description": "Phanes is the 2nd planet from Rigil, and the largest known. It hosts a plethora of moons, two of which are nearly the size of Earth. Despite it being a gas giant, it's actually a pale blue in color due to its proximity to Rigel Kentaurus, due to it being only 1.173 AU from its star. It is too hot for ammonia clouds to form. Instead, they are replaced by water ice, resulting in white or pale-blue bands. Although slightly less dense than water, it has a mass of 0.786 times Jupiter's Mass. Scientists are unsure how Pandora and Ptolemy formed around a gas giant with a mass like this; however, a Traumatic collision with another planet likely formed them. Or they are captured rocky planets."
    },
