      },
      "isNameUserDefined": true,
      "description": "The Main Jewel of Alpha Centauri, Pandora, is a Vibrant world, home to thousands of different species. a Highly Recommended Refuel and Tourist destination, though, do not anger the Natives, the R.D.A Learnt that lesson. Vast oceans cover Pandora, teaming with life. And the view of Phanes from here is truly beautiful, Tidally locked to Phanes, like its Sibling moons. A single Pandoran day is 41 hours. and in some times of the year, you can see both Alpha Centauri A And B in the sky, appearing as a Yellow and Smaller Orange star."
