      "description": "Khione, also known as Oceanus, is the Last Planet of Rigil Kentaurus, a Warm Ice giant with a handful of small moons, many of which are barely large enough to be spherical. This small number of moons is unusual for a Planet as big as Oceanus. It's possible that, due to its distance from Rigil Kentaurus, Toluman's influence on Rigil's Outer protoplanetary disk starved Oceanus of remaining material to form large moons."
    },
