      "isNameUserDefined": true,
      "description": "Perseus is the closest planet to Rigil Kentaurus and the smallest in the system. It is classified as a mini Neptune, with a mass six times that of Earth. Despite its Tranquil, Cerulean atmosphere, the reality is anything but peaceful. Daytime temperatures reach 492 °C. Even on the night side, temperatures are blazing. Wind speeds on Perseus surpass those of the fastest hurricanes on Earth. This planet is the closest thing to hell on Earth. Additionally, it has two minuscule moons orbiting close to Perseus."
